{"version":1,"content":"<p>現年61歲的前亞視當家小生尹天照，當年憑藉神劇《我和殭屍有個約會》走紅。</p><p>戲裏深情的他，戲外同樣是一名專一好男人。</p><p>近日，尹天照受訪網上節目訪問，罕有透露與妻子相濡以沫的抗癌經歷，並宣布未來計劃賣掉香港物業，移居內地過無壓力的退休生活。</p><p>&lt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:20:30.929563+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T14:01:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T04:13:25.537332+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:13:25.537332+00:00","content_hash":"d8c56b8fdf1f1d0eb4a438eb11983ed6387dded679ad49146ce38ef207ddde1d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}